ment context regarding disk image synthesis and QA checks.\"\n  },\n  \"expert_time_estimate\": {\n    \"outcome\": \"fail\",\n    \"explanation\": \"The expert_time_estimate_hours field is missing from task.toml metadata.\"\n  },\n  \"task_toml_schema\": {\n    \"outcome\": \"fail\",\n    \"explanation\": \"task.toml includes unrecognised keys under [task] (version, description, authors, keywords) that a"]
